    <h1 class="title mathjax"><span class="descriptor">Title:</span>Constraints on Neutrino Physics from DESI DR2 BAO and DR1 Full Shape</h1>
    <div class="authors"><span class="descriptor">Authors:</span><a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Elbers,+W" rel="nofollow">W. Elbers</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Aviles,+A" rel="nofollow">A. Aviles</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Noriega,+H+E" rel="nofollow">H. E. Noriega</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chebat,+D" rel="nofollow">D. Chebat</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Menegas,+A" rel="nofollow">A. Menegas</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Frenk,+C+S" rel="nofollow">C. S. Frenk</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Garcia-Quintero,+C" rel="nofollow">C. Garcia-Quintero</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gonzalez,+D" rel="nofollow">D. Gonzalez</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ishak,+M" rel="nofollow">M. Ishak</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lahav,+O" rel="nofollow">O. Lahav</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Naidoo,+K" rel="nofollow">K. Naidoo</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Niz,+G" rel="nofollow">G. Niz</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Y%C3%A8che,+C" rel="nofollow">C. Yèche</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Abdul-Karim,+M" rel="nofollow">M. Abdul-Karim</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ahlen,+S" rel="nofollow">S. Ahlen</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Alves,+O" rel="nofollow">O. Alves</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/astro-ph?searchtype=author&amp;query=Andrade,+U" rel="nofollow">U. Andrade</